{"id":"eda3df85f724c1ae","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-craig-interpolation.md","title":"Craig Interpolation","display":"df-craig-interpolation — Craig Interpolation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-craig-interpolation","aliases":["93-df-craig-interpolation"],"display":"df-craig-interpolation — Craig Interpolation","depends_on":["[[93-df-logic]]","[[93-df-formula]]","[[93-df-consequence]]","[[93-df-interpolant]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-craig-interpolation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-craig-interpolation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-craig-interpolation — Craig Interpolation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bd7e4207897c8db3\" href=\"?note=bd7e4207897c8db3\" title=\"93-df-logic\">93-df-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c2ca1af9af149e69\" href=\"?note=c2ca1af9af149e69\" title=\"93-df-formula\">93-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"afd7605d365be7b6\" href=\"?note=afd7605d365be7b6\" title=\"93-df-consequence\">93-df-consequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f7efc342a84d366e\" href=\"?note=f7efc342a84d366e\" title=\"93-df-interpolant\">93-df-interpolant</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> is a logic-pair candidate, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> is its connective-type candidate, and its consequence relation is bound in the assertion.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\">\\(\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\\)</span> is the sourced formula carrier of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c2ca1af9af149e69\" href=\"?note=c2ca1af9af149e69\" title=\"93-df-formula\">93-df-formula</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau_{\\mathcal L}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau_{\\mathcal L}}\\)</span> is the sourced type-indexed finitary structural-logic predicate.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Intp}_{93}(\\theta,\\varphi,\\psi;\\mathcal L,\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\">\\(\\mathrm{Intp}_{93}(\\theta,\\varphi,\\psi;\\mathcal L,\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\\)</span> is the type-indexed predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f7efc342a84d366e\" href=\"?note=f7efc342a84d366e\" title=\"93-df-interpolant\">93-df-interpolant</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Craig}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Craig}_{93}\\)</span> is defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}craig\\text{-}interpolation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Craig}_{93}(\\mathcal L;\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists F\\;\\exists\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\;\\Bigl[{}&amp;\nF=\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\n\\land\\mathcal L=\\langle F,\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau_{\\mathcal L}}(F,\\vdash_{\\mathcal L})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in F\\;\\bigl(\n\\{\\varphi\\}\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\psi\n\\to\\exists\\theta\\in F\\;\\mathrm{Intp}_{93}(\\theta,\\varphi,\\psi;\\mathcal L,\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}craig\\text{-}interpolation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Craig}_{93}(\\mathcal L;\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists F\\;\\exists\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\;\\Bigl[{}&amp;\nF=\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\n\\land\\mathcal L=\\langle F,\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau_{\\mathcal L}}(F,\\vdash_{\\mathcal L})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in F\\;\\bigl(\n\\{\\varphi\\}\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\psi\n\\to\\exists\\theta\\in F\\;\\mathrm{Intp}_{93}(\\theta,\\varphi,\\psi;\\mathcal L,\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This definition supports interpolation theorems and propositions.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-logic","status":"resolved","id":"bd7e4207897c8db3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"c2ca1af9af149e69","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-consequence","status":"resolved","id":"afd7605d365be7b6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-consequence]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-interpolant","status":"resolved","id":"f7efc342a84d366e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-interpolant]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"c2ca1af9af149e69","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau_{\\mathcal L})$ is the sourced formula carrier of [[93-df-formula]].","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-interpolant","status":"resolved","id":"f7efc342a84d366e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Intp}_{93}(\\theta,\\varphi,\\psi;\\mathcal L,\\tau_{\\mathcal L})$ is the type-indexed predicate of [[93-df-interpolant]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{\\mathcal L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau_{\\mathcal L})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau_{\\mathcal L}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Intp}_{93}(\\theta,\\varphi,\\psi;\\mathcal L,\\tau_{\\mathcal L})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Craig}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}craig\\text{-}interpolation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Craig}_{93}(\\mathcal L;\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists F\\;\\exists\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\;\\Bigl[{}&\nF=\\operatorname{Fm}_{93}(\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\n\\land\\mathcal L=\\langle F,\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau_{\\mathcal L}}(F,\\vdash_{\\mathcal L})\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in F\\;\\bigl(\n\\{\\varphi\\}\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\psi\n\\to\\exists\\theta\\in F\\;\\mathrm{Intp}_{93}(\\theta,\\varphi,\\psi;\\mathcal L,\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1544,"backlinks":[{"id":"146be3a41dc20483","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal L$ and $\\tau_{\\mathcal L}$ (a logic and its connective type in the scope of [[93-df-craig-interpolation]])"},{"id":"af4bf41c645962b1","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5ce5e89e178fbbbe","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Craig}_{93}(\\mathsf L;\\tau^{\\mathsf{CPL}}_{93})$ is the type-indexed interpolation property of [[93-df-craig-interpolation]]."}],"outgoing":["bd7e4207897c8db3","c2ca1af9af149e69","afd7605d365be7b6","f7efc342a84d366e"]}